<title>SINGAPORE: ABR Holdings to buy 51 pct of P.T. Aneka.</title>
<headline>ABR Holdings to buy 51 pct of P.T. Aneka.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foods group ABR Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had agreed to buy 51 percent of Indonesia's P.T. Aneka Food Tatarasa Industri (AFTI) from P.T. Panjang Sejahtera Perkasa (PSP) for US$1.6 million.</p>
<p>It said PSP would retain a 14 percent interest in AFTI.</p>
<p>AFTI produces and sells sauces and fruit-based snack foods, ABR said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition would have no significant impact on its earnings in the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
